{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29016","headline":"冬日登越王台怀归 · 许浑","name":"冬日登越王台怀归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月沈高岫宿云开，万里归心独上来。\n河畔雪飞扬子宅，海边花盛越王台。\n泷分桂岭鱼难过，瘴近衡峯鴈却回。\n乡信渐稀人渐老，只应频看一枝梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}